l=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> By the same measure, as Hera embraces same-sex marriage, Dionysus grows frustrated with mainstreaming assimilation of what was once firmly in his domain.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dionsyos is so happy to have made it to the age of hookup apps, I'm not sure he minds, and I also think there's some icky implications there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T16:33:38-07:00","id":1197781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1197777#post1197777\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Dionsyos is so happy to have made it to the age of hookup apps, I'm not sure he minds, and I also think there's some icky implications there.</div> </div> </div> </div>It was meant to represent the opinion of some of the more radical queer activists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-20-2018, 09:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T18:39:48-07:00","id":1197821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1197754#post1197754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Zeus loathes commitment. I don't see him getting poly married when he already has so much trouble with just the one.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Agreed and I view Hela as firmly not wanting to share her position as Queen of the Universe. It would very much weaken her position wife. Hela would lose any illusion of equality with the king of the Universe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T22:03:34-07:00","id":1197891,"title":"","content":"Surprisingly, Scion nationalists overthrowing nations to bring back the &quot;old ways&quot; isn't the massive, constant problem you would expect for a setting about super powered embodiments of ancient cultures running around. This is partially due to the syncretic, ever changing and omnipresent nature of the gods. Most pantheons change and adapt with their people, so regressive and traditionalist ideas about nation-states are about the same as our world. A threat, but not an all encompassing one, Not to mention history is better taught and remembered because of the existence of immortal beings who actually remember that the good old days weren't always so good.<br /> <br /> However many mortals and their governments are very aware of the possibility of being overthrown by the Scions of a &quot;dead pantheon.&quot; A daughter of Al'Uzza not happy with Saudi Arabia's treatment of women could overthrow things overnight, An insane Incarnation of Taranis might declare war against the children of Divus Julius and Italy by proxy. Even an active Pantheon like the Kami might have a rouge son of Amaterasu who becomes a wanna be Yukio Mishima and try to bring back the Imperial Cult in Japan. It's unlikely and hasn't happened in the modern era but it's a fear mortals can't help but have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11643,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","user":"Corax","date":". 03-21-2018, 01:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","name":"Corax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T12:25:11-07:00","id":1198069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Corax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1197891#post1197891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> However many mortals and their governments are very aware of the possibility of being overthrown by the Scions of a &quot;dead pantheon.&quot; A daughter of Al'Uzza not happy with Saudi Arabia's treatment of women could overthrow things overnight, An insane Incarnation of Taranis might declare war against the children of Divus Julius and Italy by proxy. Even an active Pantheon like the Kami might have a rouge son of Amaterasu who becomes a wanna be Yukio Mishima and try to bring back the Imperial Cult in Japan. It's unlikely and hasn't happened in the modern era but it's a fear mortals can't help but have.</div> </div> </div> </div>This makes me imagine the chaos from Scions stemming from the gods of destroyed peoples/cultures now venting their frustrations on the oppressor culture by destroying the current regime. Just how many different Native American pantheons are we aware of exactly?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T17:23:41-07:00","id":1198172,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksol-aeternium</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1198069#post1198069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This makes me imagine the chaos from Scions stemming from the gods of destroyed peoples/cultures now venting their frustrations on the oppressor culture by destroying the current regime. Just how many different Native American pantheons are we aware of exactly?</div> </div> </div> </div>My games deal heavily with how Scions affect international politics and my group has decided that the reason this hasn't happened yet is mostly because of the looming Titan War. Scions of disenfranchised groups are more worried about the potential coming cosmic disasters destroying what they have left over settling old grudges. At least for right now. I also think pantheons like the Orisha are outliers in the belief that Titans are a label and not an actual threat. The Orisha can afford to think a nice platitude like that because they haven't seen the reality of the horrors of a Titanomachy the same way the Teotl, Theoi and Deva have firsthand. Of course the Orisha aren't fools though, they recognize the evil of mortals first and foremost, which is a wisdom the other pantheons don't share.<br /> <br /> (FYI my claim that the Orisha are wrong about the Titan threat is based only on previews where Titans are depicted by every other Pantheon and the setting chapters in Origins to absolutely be a threat. . I don't have the full text of Origins and Hero so I might be completely wrong about that.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11643,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","user":"Corax","date":".  Grammar 03-24-2018, 04:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11643-corax","name":"Corax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T14:56:03-07:00","id":1198852,"title":"","content":"Hmmm other things the mere presence of gods is likely to affect;<br /> <br /> The internet will be home to some truly obnoxious viruses and malware once the trickster gods (and/or their scions) discover computers, which will prompt god-tier antiviral software from the Forge/Smith type gods who might dabble in such matters (or maybe their nascent tech-deity Scions) and whom might be invested in NOT spreading waves of electronic chaos.<br /> <br /> The etiquette of online posters could change drastically knowing that they'll never know if the person they're trolling/shitposting to is actually a deity who can and will smite them through the computer screen. And while I support such things happening it may take a few times before it really sinks in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T17:34:01-07:00","id":1198908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksol-aeternium</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1198852#post1198852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm other things the mere presence of gods is likely to affect;<br /> <br /> The internet will be home to some truly obnoxious viruses and malware once the trickster gods (and/or their scions) discover computers, which will prompt god-tier antiviral software from the Forge/Smith type gods who might dabble in such matters (or maybe their nascent tech-deity Scions) and whom might be invested in NOT spreading waves of electronic chaos.<br /> <br /> The etiquette of online posters could change drastically knowing that they'll never know if the person they're trolling/shitposting to is actually a deity who can and will smite them through the computer screen. And while I support such things happening it may take a few times before it really sinks in.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hehe, I guess some Scion out there could be racking up deeds by moderating a forum that does divinity AMAs, preventing (and occasionally <b>fixing</b>!) dangerous pranks from trickster gods, curses and smiting from deities over real or imagined slights, escalating cult X cult trolling and so on...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T20:09:45-07:00","id":1210249,"title":"","content":"The International Games (formerly Olympics) are a nightmare. Only 100% human mortals are allowed to compete, and no one is allowed to directly attack contestants. These rules are followed (mostly... recently... we think), but Gods tend to see the rest (DO NOT INTERFERE being at the top of the list) as guidelines when it pertains to their favorites. Several Scions observe from the sidelines, with the thought that one of them will report any blatant interference, but it still happens. To minimize temptation, there are very few multi-day events, and everything is a little shorter in the World. Still, underdogs win with surprising frequency, simply because no one is working against them. Every few decades, a pantheon (esp. the Theoi) petitions to use their name for the games. Fairly frequently, it goes through. Of course, when the 'home name advantage' inevitably backfires and leads to embarrassing losses, the sponsors don't argue against IG for the next several rounds.<br /> <br /> Tired of all this nonsense, a group of Scions is working on a special God Channel with a significant delay, but the logistics and sales pitch are proving about as difficult as expected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18839-zilaenor","name":"zilaenor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-20T20:53:44-07:00","id":1237391,"title":"","content":"Thanks to the heroism of native Scions, native nations maintain higher populations than in our world, their linguistic and religious traditions are stronger, their sovereign lands larger, and fundamentally more sovereign (harder for state and federal governments to override their local decisions and they have more law enforcement power, including over outsiders on their lands). Six Grandfathers was not desecrated with the faces of US Presidents, and while Hawaii is a state with a republican government like the other 49, the native nation also has its internal recognized sovereignty with its maintained monarchy (Hawaii might have an extra island that's Terra Incognita, I haven't decided yet).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-20T23:13:08-07:00","id":1237421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1197024#post1197024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Aphrodite's pan! Also super dom (she's all about CONTROL), which is why she keeps coming back to Ares among all the Olympians - because he's actually a complete sub in the bedroom.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I wouldn't say he's a sub, but the most violent and angry deity in that pantheon is definitely into some kinky shit! And who better to satisfy his fetishes than the patron goddess of prostitutes?<br /> <br /> Maybe that's why he wages so many wars all the time? He needs the spoils to pay Aphrodite's bill! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-20T23:22:19-07:00","id":1237424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1237421#post1237421\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I wouldn't say he's a sub, but the most violent and angry deity in that pantheon is definitely into some kinky shit! And who better to satisfy his fetishes than the patron goddess of prostitutes?<br /> <br /> Maybe that's why he wages so many wars all the time? He needs the spoils to pay Aphrodite's bill! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Total sub in the bedroom. It's where he wants to be dominated after being an &quot;alpha&quot;-asshole everywhere else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-21T04:51:36-07:00","id":1237455,"title":"","content":"That's quite hilarious and fits them very well. On the subject of love goddesses, Ishtar has actually matured and become a far more compassionate goddess in the modern day. Having to rescue her love Tammuz from the underworld was a growing experience for her. Chronologically speaking, the Tammuz incident happened after the Epic of Gilgamesh and most of Ishtar's other less pleasant behavior in the original myth in my headcanon.<br /> <br /> That's not to say that she's changed completely though. One of the best ways to know that you've amassed a reputation as a serious supernatural badass in the World is to receive a visit from Ishtar. She's just far more of an ethical slut though now, no longer sending giant bull monsters to try to murder heroes who refuse her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-21T07:17:21-07:00","id":1237490,"title":"","content":"Growing concerns about Dionysus' physical and mental health encouraged his children to stage an intervention with the hopes of getting him cleaned up.<br /> <br /> According to eye witness accounts, the God of Wine and Orgies had instigated a riot within the first two hours of being admitted to the rehabilitation facility.<br /> <br /> When asked for an interview later about their thoughts or involvement with the incident, his children refused to comment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 07-21-2018, 10:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T13:25:28-07:00","id":1239032,"title":"","content":"Just as judges where robes out of tradition (and in many countries, wigs), US senators in the Senate chamber wear togas in the World.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T18:57:20-07:00","id":1240276,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking about other national goddesses besides the 3 Chosen of Athena we know (Britannia, Marianne, and Colombia).<br /> <br /> Besides Eriu herself (always goddess of the land itself, and readopted by the Republic of Ireland as their national goddess), I have two ideas on how to handle Hibernia and Caitlin ni Uallachain, patron goddesses of Irish Unionism and Nationalism respectively, still at work in North Ireland, while Eriu represents the Republic. Possibility 1 is that Hibernia is younger sister of Britannia (as she's portrayed to be in 19th Century Unionist propaganda), and thus another Chosen of Athena, while Caitlin is daughter of Eriu.<br /> <br /> The other option is to lean into their portrayal as a young maiden (Hibernia) and old crone (Caitlin), and go for the idea that they're modern adapted faces of Bonba and Fodla - Eriu's sister-selves in Irish myth, the three having been Fate bound in the modern era to the &quot;Maiden/Mother/Crone&quot; symbology.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T11:17:49-07:00","id":1241935,"title":"","content":"Just numbering these because, you know, they're mine and I have more than one of them. XD<br /> <br /> 1) the Modern Age has seen amazing breakthroughs not just in the sciences, though fields like Quantum Physics, but also in Pan-Theology, where noted scholars have been putting together more and more advanced understandings of how the mythological underpinnings of reality come together and create The World. That said, while there have been great strides forward in this field, these have been hampered by the fact that so many of it's foremost minds end up a little... unhinged... by their attempts to peer into the abyss between different mythologies. It would appear that humanity just isn't supposed to know how the mythological underpinnings of reality really function.<br /> <br /> 2) Local myths and legends abound in <i>every</i> part of modern society, and even though the average modern person hasn't had any direct experience with such things most people trade around stories about numerous topics. A small handful of Denizens that live 'nearby', how a small branch of their family migrated to some Terra Incognita a few generations back, or just an oft-repeated tale about some &quot;seven degrees of Mythology&quot; apocryphal tale. The most common of these, buried in the family trees of a thousand different families, is some vague association with one deity or even multiple different gods that lurks almost forgotten in their ancestry.<br /> <br /> 3) It's rare to see the mass media dealing with the doings of Heroes and Titanspawn, excepting only the largest and most blatantly obvious acts. Even then, mostly these issues get regional attention at best, showing up on local news outlets as small mentions or the occasional fully-developed story. It's in these gaps that godbloggers tend to find their niche, covering these issues in more detail at some cost of accuracy, but <i>every so often</i> a local story will get picked up for wider distribution-- becoming a national or even worldwide <b>thing</b>. When this happens, most Scions 'in the know' become profoundly glad that it's not a more common occurrence, as this is pretty much always a sign that things are about to get much worse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/728-crownedsun","name":"CrownedSun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar728_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"217"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-13T22:47:40-07:00","id":1245767,"title":"","content":"<b>Ooh, here's a good one:</b><br /> <br /> <br /> The nations of the world have created an international police force designed specifically to deal with threats of a more supernatural nature. This police force is staffed by Scions, cultists and even creatures who are associated with Law, Order and Protection, where they can defend society against those who would selfishly abuse their powers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-13T23:05:06-07:00","id":1245773,"title":"","content":"For my table:<br /> <br /> There are national champions that work for their governments, and bands under the auspices of international organizations like NATO exist. But a truly global international police force is not something the various governments are willing to give up their sovereignty to the necessary degree to sign on to. If there\u2019s a society of Order-associated Scions protecting civilization and the global balance of power, its doing it from the shadows without answering to governmental authorities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 08-14-2018, 02:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-13T23:05:11-07:00","id":1245774,"title":"","content":"A sort of Scion Interpol? That could be pretty awesome! Especially since there's all sorts of hooks for PC agents. For those who don't like busting heads, there's the endless bureaucracy to deal with too. And I imagine Gods of every pantheon would love to influence it one way or the other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3714-mysteris","name":"Mysteris","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T09:34:59-07:00","id":1245918,"title":"","content":"In my head canon, Iris adopted the Internet as her domain, and has become much more important among the Theoi as a result. As well, she (and others like her from other Pantheons) is responsible for the net <i>not</i> turning into a wasteland where tricksters run rampant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T10:32:20-07:00","id":1245954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1245773#post1245773\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For my table:<br /> <br /> There are national champions that work for their governments, and bands under the auspices of international organizations like NATO exist. But a truly global international police force is not something the various governments are willing to give up their sovereignty to the necessary degree to sign on to. If there\u2019s a society of Order-associated Scions protecting civilization and the global balance of power, its doing it from the shadows without answering to governmental authorities.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I like to think the reason the nations banded together to create this force is because their leaders are (hopefully) smart enough to realize that ordinary cops and soldiers don't stand much chance against giants, dragons,sorcerers, rogue Scions and other kinds of Legendary threats. They need a team of specialists who not only have the knowledge, but also the power to counteract their abilities.<br /> <br /> Sure, you could say the nations of the world can just use modern weaponry against them, but then you have to remember some of these individuals (or even entire races) are supernaturally talented at craftsmanship. I have little doubt they would already be working on technology decades ahead of the rest of the world in this setting.<br /> <br /> Thus, it becomes an alliance of necessity. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-14-2018, 01:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T10:42:17-07:00","id":1245958,"title":"","content":"Sure, and they do recruit Scions for that. But a single international organization that the US, China, Israel, Iran, India, and Pakistan all recognize the authority of and knowingly let operate in their national borders strains my suspension of disbelief far more than dragons do.<br /> <br /> Maybe something like a UN reinforcement team that can be invited in when there\u2019s a problem to big for local Scions to handle if the country is desperate<br /> <br /> Not to say there aren\u2019t globe trotting do-gooder scions, or international societies dedicated to maintaining order. Just that I don\u2019t see them operating in an official governmental capacity.<br /> <br /> For my table\u2019s purposes of course!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 08-14-2018, 02:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T12:30:46-07:00","id":1246022,"title":"","content":"Gerald Gardner did found a new religious movement that claims a reconstruction heritage, but Wicca does not claim to have been a continuously practiced secret tradition in the World. Rather it asserts to be a rediscovery if the true nature of all Gods as being a reflection of underlying Divine archetypes that cross all cultural boundaries and Wiccans freely worship across Pantheon lines accordingly.<br /> <br /> Wicca in the World is about as mainstream as Unitarian Universalism in reality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 08-14-2018, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T15:28:34-07:00","id":1246080,"title":"","content":"Rather than living in exile in India, the Dalai Lama and the unrecognized Tibetan government are holed up in the Terra Incognita of Shamballah. With the obvious help of the Palas, His Holiness is able to bypass the Chinese military moving to and from Shamballah.<br /> <br /> For their part, the Chinese government works very hard to keeps its registered Scions our of Tibet. It is well aware that the only reason the Palas and Lha limit themselves to passive protection rather than directly acting against Chinese colonization is because it\u2019s purely a mortal effort and doing so would violate a number of treaties among the Pantheons - but if divine power were brought to bare for the People\u2019s Republic, then their gloves could come off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 08-14-2018, 06:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T16:12:34-07:00","id":1246100,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1246080#post1246080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rather than living in exile in India, the Dalai Lama and the unrecognized Tibetan government are holed up in the Terra Incognita of Shamballah. With the obvious help of the Palas, His Holiness is able to bypass the Chinese military moving to and from Shamballah.<br /> <br /> For their part, the Chinese government works very hard to keeps its registered Scions our of Tibet. It is well aware that the only reason the Palas and Lha limit themselves to passive protection rather than directly acting against Chinese colonization is because it\u2019s purely a mortal effort and doing so would violate a number of treaties among the Pantheons - but if divine power were brought to bare for the People\u2019s Republic, then their gloves could come off.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I just had a rather amusing thought regarding how the Chinese government passed a law stating that monks required their permission to reincarnate.<br /> <br /> That... might... actually be a problem in the Scion setting! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T16:28:17-07:00","id":1246106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1246100#post1246100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I just had a rather amusing thought regarding how the Chinese government passed a law stating that monks required their permission to reincarnate.<br /> <br /> That... might... actually be a problem in the Scion setting! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>The Celestial Bureaucaxy expects Yama to obey Chinese law, but he isn\u2019t only a god of the Shen. A devout Buddhist himself, he plans on filing as many Tibetan Buddhist souls, and even Chinese Buddhist souls as possible under the purview of the Palas and not the Celestial Bureaucracy to get around that measure for the time being.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-15T17:26:18-07:00","id":1246479,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1246106#post1246106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Celestial Bureaucaxy expects Yama to obey Chinese law, but he isn\u2019t only a god of the Shen. A devout Buddhist himself, he plans on filing as many Tibetan Buddhist souls, and even Chinese Buddhist souls as possible under the purview of the Palas and not the Celestial Bureaucracy to get around that measure for the time being.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can see some Departments of the Shen being complict in this scheme, particularly in the case of honourable ancestor who have already been assigned getting reincarnated and reclassifed until this mortal law is either removed or overturned within the Celestial Bureacracy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T08:09:09-07:00","id":1247023,"title":"","content":"Given the numbers of love deities influencing the World (a good number having a definition of love as a complicating, star-crossed thing), the views of the mortal population on love must be quite different. Love Is<b> Serious. </b>It tends to attract the attention of Fate (or at least, the interest of adequately Purviewed Deities), and it can't - ever - be - easy. It can be maddening, holy, sultry, or outright annihilating - but it can't be lukewarm or mediocre.<br /> <br /> Creating one's first account on a dating sites is pretty close in importance to a sexual first time (or even a first communion - let's remember than many a God has its own dating site).<br /> <br /> Rom coms make up more than half of the nominations at awards shows, as their dramatic content isn't sappy, but simply adequate accounts of things that happen quite often (and yup, &quot;romantic horror&quot; is a totally established genre).<br /> <br /> Best-selling authors write dating sims, that are seriously studied in schools to prepare the pupils for the real life.<br /> <br /> There's probably a tacit &quot;infatuation leave&quot; planned by most companies to allow new lovers to cope with the trials Fate throws at them to test their feelings.<br /> <br /> A casual love-story, without dramatic twists, or a simple hook-up without transcendental ecstasy kicking in, is regarded pretty much like many people in our world conceive love at first sight: an extremely rare event that can happen, once in a blue moon, but is mostly an idealized fantasy born of wishful thinking and fictitious accounts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11431,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11431-adrasalieth","user":"Adrasalieth","date":". 11-27-2018, 04:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11431-adrasalieth","name":"Adrasalieth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T10:28:31-07:00","id":1247065,"title":"","content":"These seem to be all the ways having Scions and Gods around would make the world a better place (at least kinda). What about ways that the world would be worse off with these kind of supernatural beings running around?<br /> Like, for example, nuclear weapons specifically being designed to help human governments deal with the threats of gods and their kids. Maybe the Cuban Missile Crisis in this world was the US threatening to nuke Cuba off the map unless they gave up some criminal (or even perceived criminal) scions. There are plenty of real life examples for fictionalized portrayals.<br /> <br /> Not to go against the setting at all, I guess I let the World of Darkness in too much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":961,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","user":"ChewyGranola","date":".  Clarifying what I was saying 08-17-2018, 01:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T11:06:06-07:00","id":1247082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChewyGranola</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1247065#post1247065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These seem to be all the ways having Scions and Gods around would make the world a better place (at least kinda). What about ways that the world would be worse off with these kind of supernatural beings running around?</div> </div> </div> </div><i>&quot;And in other news, the death toll among outer city gangs is at an all time high, as reports of human sacrifices continue to increase among the Hispanic and Latino communities!&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-17-2018, 02:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T11:58:34-07:00","id":1247107,"title":"","content":"Bad things that can happen? Alrighty then;<br /> <br /> -Obviously there will be various ongoing (hot &amp; cold) religious wars as while the gods may abide in political detente, fanatical human worshipers tend to take the faith and run with it.<br /> <br /> -Chaotic, mischievous, trickster gods (&amp; demigods) randomly meddling in people\u2019s lives will instill a higher level of resentment in the minds of mortals who, frankly, are tired of all the bother. Life is hard enough just with mortal BS, and worse with more of it coming from monsters &amp; titans, without adding additional BS from the \u201cgods\u201d to the mix. For that mater, as you mentioned, aspiring trickter scions staging epic heists and thefts undermining the financial stability of nations isn\u2019t likely to go over well.<br /> <br /> -Crosspantheon customs will slow tourism and negatively affect global trade as people become wary of any culture outside of their own lest they offend some foreign god or fall prey to some foreign monster.<br /> <br /> -The fact that literally anyone could be a disguised deity (or quasi-deity) will make the dating scene a literal minefield. There\u2019s no telling whether this person you just met is a monster, god, demigod, or scion incognito, so people will be extra-wary. Of course, on the plus side that will bring an end to any non-deific misogyny for fear of being cursed or killed &amp; eaten.<br /> <br /> Hmm\u2026 Active gods will hurt the insurance business, devils actually making people do things puts a monkeywrench into legal proceedings, exorcism and cleansing will become a new industry, divination will see a boom in business, more as I think of em.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T12:12:24-07:00","id":1247111,"title":"","content":"And don't forget the level of Orwellian surveillance governements would probably inflict on their populations to regulate the apparition of new religions. Not only to avoid the fanatical zealots parts, but because it only takes enough believers to, ya know, <i>create a full blown wild card Pantheon that has retroactively existed since the beginning of the COSMOS<br /> <br /> </i><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> -Crosspantheon customs will slow tourism and negatively affect global trade as people become wary of any culture outside of their own lest they offend some foreign god or fall prey to some foreign monster. </div> </div> </div>Or it could be the reverse. Imagine a Kami materializing in Western Lands and sighing in disbelief as it feels its Mantle shift to accomodate the paradigm of weeaboos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11431,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11431-adrasalieth","user":"Adrasalieth","date":". 08-17-2018, 03:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11431-adrasalieth","name":"Adrasalieth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T12:50:49-07:00","id":1247129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksol-aeternium</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1247107#post1247107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hmm\u2026 Active gods will hurt the insurance business, devils actually making people do things puts a monkeywrench into legal proceedings, exorcism and cleansing will become a new industry, divination will see a boom in business, more as I think of em.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Devout Cultist:</b> I just bought my family some volcano insurance!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Normal Citizen:</b> That's stupid, there's no volcano around here for thousands of miles!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Hephaestus:</b> ... Hold my Ambrosia!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T13:41:44-07:00","id":1247147,"title":"","content":"I wonder if there would be an active anti-Gods/supernatural group. I can imagine them getting sick of the gods for all the reasons above and possibly doing things like committing terrorist acts on temples/holy sites, kidnapping cultists, and lobbying for tougher restrictions on the supernatural.<br /> <br /> &quot;In the news today, the radical anti-deity group No Gods, No Masters has detonated an IED in front of the Temple of Anubis in Chicago today, injuring 25 and killing at least 8. The radical group was responsible for the disruption of the Festival of Bacchus in San Antonio this March, as well as the kidnapping and eventual murder of Anubis High Priest Bob Jones in January&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T13:48:06-07:00","id":1247151,"title":"","content":"That's a possibility but wouldn't the Gods either squash such a group themselves or send in their Scions to do it? Or just let the Titans nom on them the next time they show up and then warn people that becoming Titan-chow is a risk if you piss off your resident deities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3714-mysteris","name":"Mysteris","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-17T17:56:54-07:00","id":1247246,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mysteris</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1247151#post1247151\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's a possibility but wouldn't the Gods either squash such a group themselves or send in their Scions to do it? Or just let the Titans nom on them the next time they show up and then warn people that becoming Titan-chow is a risk if you piss off your resident deities.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Yeah, just take a look at Greek mythology if you want examples of how the Gods respond to insults from mortals.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-17-2018, 09:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T12:23:57-07:00","id":1247776,"title":"","content":"There are many series along the lines of X for Dummies, targeting some area of life (First Kiss, Hiking, Dyslexia) and compiling connected mythology - what/who causes this? what will improve your chances? Who will shun you? Where are the best places to go for this?<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, while many Gods are flattered by their inclusion in such books, others will inevitably be insulted for being left out (or inaccuracies, being lumped in with others, etc.). While the backlash usually lands on writers/publishers, some Gods aren't as discriminating. In fact, there have been a few cases where widespread popularity of a particular ritual has led to a reversal of the effects - cursing instead of blessing.<br /> <br /> Another issue is intentionally false inclusions. Tricksters are fond of inserting ridiculous and embarrassing acts. More worrisome are the Titan cults, who seek widespread adoption of certain rituals to weaken their master's bindings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18839-zilaenor","name":"zilaenor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-19T12:45:29-07:00","id":1247782,"title":"","content":"Brigid is, at this point, reigning Queen of the Tuatha de Danaan, on account of Manannan not technically qualifying and The Morrigan both a) not really being the political leadership type and b) being kind of on the back foot due to three thirds of her being dead (things get harder for you when there's only one third of you to go around, y'know?). Brigid technically has some connection to leadership due to her (ex?-)husband, and everyone else with a better claim is dead (and therefore disfigured). This is the reason for her recent increase in prominence in the religion. She doesn't have the Leader Calling yet, not having held the position long enough, and therefore plot happens.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12989-center-of-all","name":"Center-of-All","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T14:28:36-07:00","id":1251493,"title":"","content":"While worship of the Canaanite/Phoenician gods (the Elohim) has continuously survived in the World unlike in reality, it has not done so in the ancient land of Canaan (Israel and Palestine). North Africa, in what was historically the Cartheginian Empire, is the heartland of Elohim worship.<br /> <br /> To the shock of Elohim and Mal\u2019akhim alike, secular Zionists have invited Elohim worshipers of Canaanite ancestry to immigrate to Israel. This move is opposed by both religious Zionists (who see it as a desecration of YHWH\u2019s commandment to take Ancient Canaan from the idolaters) and anti-Zionists (who see it as an effort to settle more territory and further push aside the Palestinian population).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-07T13:15:02-07:00","id":1252328,"title":"","content":"The most well known cult to champion lgbt culture and issues in the Western world is of course the Dionysians, for whom gender liberation is a sacred matter. There are other lgbt associated cults though with much stricter relationships to gender (which is not to say they are unaccepting of trans men or women, but the gender fluid and queer would have less of a place among them, as they specifically exalt MANHOOD or WOMANHOOD as central to their religion). The Cult of Artemis obviously approaches womanhood this way, and would not be particularly surprising to anyone from our world familiar with lesbian feminist communes. The precedent of Sipriotes assures an embrace of trans women among their number.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, the Mithraic Mysteries are exclusively male and exalt expressions of manhood, virility, and masculinity - including a reputation for sexualizing said expressions in man-on-man worship, and warrior bonding. Hermes has been known to joke about Mithras\u2019 \u201cmasc4masc\u201d Grindr profile.<br /> <br /> (Note: this is Roman Mithras, not the Yazata Mithra, or the Deva Mitra)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T11:11:07-07:00","id":1252553,"title":"","content":"Most attempts by mortal governments to organize and control scions in their borders have been miserable failures. While some Scions might end up a loyal servant of their government through personal loyalty or fatebinding, all attempts at \u201csuper teams\u201d inevitably fail as the Scions grow more powerful, become more embroiled in their divinely appointed duties and can\u2019t be bothered to follow mortal chains of command. The only notable exceptions are the Chinese and the Japanese, whose pantheons value obedience to the national governments of their cultures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23991-bacchicone","name":"BacchicOne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23991_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-09T18:40:37-07:00","id":1252897,"title":"","content":"My headcanon is that Scions have a subconscious tendency to spread the purview that they have the most affinity towards. For example, a Scion who's associated with the Death purview will find that their very presence brings about the deaths of those around them. Regardless if they intended for it to happen or not, those who spend too much time around a Scion of Death will inevitably become involved in some manner of horrible tragedy.<br /> <br /> <br /> On a lighter tone, a Scion who's associated with the Justice purview may find themselves constantly stumbling upon criminal activity, or sinister plots to which they constantly end up thwarting the villains and bringing the criminal element to justice. And since they're Scions, the criminals they happen to run into may be much bigger than your run of the mill street thug.<br /> <br /> <br /> Once again, the Scion may not intend for any of this to happen, but Fate just keeps willing it to happen, because these purviews are intrinsically tied to their identity as Scions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-09-2018, 09:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-11T17:53:26-07:00","id":1253434,"title":"","content":"I have this weird idea of White Wolf - or whatever their in-universe counterpart would be - having their flagship 90s game being a Scion-like <i>Olympians: The Arete</i>, with the Dodekatheoi + Hades as the 13 &quot;clans&quot; (Dionysius and Hestia in the Tremere and Salubri roles), &quot;lesser&quot; deities as &quot;bloodlines&quot;, and the Roman counterparts as the Sabbat antitribu. This followed by <i>Aesir: Ragnarock</i>, <i>Magicians: The Ma'at</i>, <i>Loa: The Riding</i>, <i>Tuatha De Dannan: The Glamour</i>, and <i>Shen: Gods of the East</i>. This might end up in some weird forms of fate binding or something, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T13:31:34-07:00","id":1253692,"title":"","content":"Santa Claus is one of the Overworld's greatest masters of Psychopomp.<br /> <br /> Visiting all the good children of the world in a single night isn't that hard when you can become omnipresent!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T16:19:11-07:00","id":1253737,"title":"","content":"The Holiday calendar in the world looks fairly different from ours. Despite many people still nominally being Christian or Muslim, the fact that most never really abandoned their Gods means that the Abrahamic holidays are a much smaller affair. Christmas, in particular, is basically a non-event, with most people putting more emphasis on Saturnalia or Yule. Many of the Aesir rib Odin during the holiday season about the proliferation of \u201cMall Odins\u201d who listen to children\u2019s gift lists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23991-bacchicone","name":"BacchicOne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23991_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T16:45:11-07:00","id":1253741,"title":"","content":"I\u2019d just abandon the Christianization of Yule/Saturnalia/etc being a thing. The original holidays are celebrated with trees and fairy lights, socks hanging for Jolnir, etc etc. Other than the absence of manger scenes, and replacing some of the more religious carols, it\u2019s largely the same. Charles Dickens\u2019 \u201cYule Carol\u201d is pretty much identical for example.<br /> <br /> Jesus being born in spring anyway, the early Church treated (and Protestants followed suit) the mass celebrating his resurrection as also celebrating his birth - which means that Jesus resurrected on his birthday. Birth and Rebirth. Manger scenes and people singing Silent Night are thus part of Pascha (overlapping in the English speaking world with the festival of the Vanir goddess Eostre, who as a goddess of spring rebirth and dawn, is comfortable sharing a birth and resurrection festival).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 09-12-2018, 09:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T20:55:06-07:00","id":1253793,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1253741#post1253741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019d just abandon the Christianization of Yule/Saturnalia/etc being a thing. The original holidays are celebrated with trees and fairy lights, socks hanging for Jolnir, etc etc. Other than the absence of manger scenes, and replacing some of the more religious carols, it\u2019s largely the same. Charles Dickens\u2019 \u201cYule Carol\u201d is pretty much identical for example.<br /> <br /> Jesus being born in spring anyway, the early Church treated (and Protestants followed suit) the mass celebrating his resurrection as also celebrating his birth - which means that Jesus resurrected on his birthday. Birth and Rebirth. Manger scenes and people singing Silent Night are thus part of Pascha (overlapping in the English speaking world with the festival of the Vanir goddess Eostre, who as a goddess of spring rebirth and dawn, is comfortable sharing a birth and resurrection festival).</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, sidenote. If Jesus\u2019 resurrection is timed to the Judaic calendar with the anniversary of his birth, that means he was born during Passover - which means Mary and Joseph had an actual good reason to be making a pilgrimage to Jerusalem, as opposed to a Roman census that definitely did not happen (Romans did not require their subjects leave their homes behind to travel to capitals for censuses, they sent out census takers; making the subjects travel for censuses WOULD BRING THE IMPERIAL ECONOMY TO A GRINDING HAULT!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-13T06:58:31-07:00","id":1253865,"title":"","content":"Let's talk healthcare !<br /> <br /> Rather than looking all white and austere, hospitals and clinics are tailored to attract Healer Scions and make them stay, as temporary or even permanent guests. From expensive suites to all-equipped bungalows, nothing is spared to make Scions feel home.<br /> <br /> The oath of Hippocrates (a Scion of Apollo himself, ascended into full-bloomed Godhood soon after the Dark Plague\u2019s end) implies a necessity to heal anyone, regardless of the Gods they worship: therefore, and to avoid sparking a negative reaction in the patient (there have been cases of some chauvinistic religious extremists refusing treatments if it involves appealing to deities they did not worship), any use of supernatural healing is supposed to be done discreetly, unless it is explicitly requested. As such, there\u2019s nothing unusual in waking from a nap to find a dreamcatcher above one\u2019s bed or tasting sage in your infusion while hearing your nurse sing-song a rhyme sounding suspiciously like a paean to Apollo. Thus goes the tacit arrangement between healers and patients.<br /> <br /> A small piece of wild nature \u2013 most commonly a glade, a lake or a cave \u2013 is always maintained near the hospital: supernatural beings with good intentions and curative abilities can hope to find an asylum there, in exchange for a little help with the patients that are sent there to \u201cgo for a walk, breathe fresh air and bask in the sun\u201d.<br /> <br /> Medical staff working in terminal care often like to work with ghosts, as they are better prepared to handle and inform a dying patient through his last days. That tends to make those services a bit less daunting and heavy than in our world.<br /> <br /> Most pregnant women choose to bear down at home: giving birth in a public hospital (or, in fact, in any place) is the door open to any creature of Fate to look down on the newborn\u2019s cradle and settle its destiny.<br /> <br /> Aesthetic surgery is irrelevant. You can get your nose, breasts or whole appeareance changed with the same amount of time and money as you would a tattoo in the real world \u2013 all it takes is buying an expensive bottle of alcohol and bring it to your local fox people in that speakeasy bar down the red-light district. It\u2019s temporary most of the time, and it has countless ways to go wrong, but hey, beauty\u2019s pain.<br /> <br /> In a world where AIDS and cancer can be tackled with a mere effort of will from a Scion\u2019s part, the most concerning health crisis is psychiatric issues. Your patient hears voices: are they only hallucinations, or are they real? Is it an indicator of a bewitchment, possession, communication with from a Godly entity, predispositions for a supernatural gift, or something else entirely? And what if, once you think you\u2019ve got it all figured out, you start to hear those voices too?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11431-adrasalieth","name":"Adrasalieth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-13T20:35:55-07:00","id":1254081,"title":"","content":"How does everybody feel about South Park's idea of society helping a young celebrity rise to the top of the popularity charts, before ritually sacrificing them in time for harvest season?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-13T20:48:19-07:00","id":1254084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1254081#post1254081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How does everybody feel about South Park's idea of society helping a young celebrity rise to the top of the popularity charts, before ritually sacrificing them in time for harvest season?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was inspired by the same thing. I wouldn\u2019t make it a big Wickerman conspiracy like on South Park, but more a thing with Fate, and certain cults respond to it.<br /> Xochiquetzal has Marilyn Monroe\u2019s skin (and thus Mantle) in her collection.<br /> <br /> (I came up with that because I have a whole list of potential US deities that player characters will have to track down in various afterlives and so-forth, to assemble a potential full Pantheon for Columbia. They\u2019ll chose which directions to follow shaping which possibilities they find, but Marilyn Monroe, if they get that sacrificial skin from Xoxhiquetzal, is the potential love, beauty, and celebrity goddess)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-15T17:48:59-07:00","id":1254656,"title":"","content":"How do you explain to your kids &quot;where do babies come from&quot; when you live in a world where magic, legends and mythology are just out in the open for everybody to see?<br /> <br /> If somebody's parents tell them they were found in a cabbage patch, or that the stork delivered them, or they were assembled in a baby factory; how the hell are you supposed to know if they're being completely serious or not?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-15T18:44:56-07:00","id":1254665,"title":"","content":"Well because that\u2019s not really myths in the traditional sense. Ancient people knew how you get babies, you take a man and a women and let them \u201cknow\u201d each other. If talking about if they knew exactly how reproduction worked nope you will find tons of incorrect theories on what happened when the mans seed was left in a women. But the idea of babies coming out of no where is something you\u2019ll see as origins of heroes and monsters or in other words Scions. So if your parents are telling you then found you in the wilderness or a messenger of some kind came and dropped you off, best bet your a Scion, if not your parents are just fibbing which will become apparent when they get older.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-15T22:07:59-07:00","id":1254691,"title":"","content":"Speaking of &quot;baby factories&quot; in regards to Scion:<br /> <br /> A Scion with an affinity for the Life purview decides to go into the field of mechanical engineering...<br /> <br /> What are the chances of them exploring the potential of bio-mechanical technology?<br /> <br /> I'm now imagining Scions running around fighting monsters while wearing suits of organic power armor!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-16-2018, 01:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T13:18:00-07:00","id":1256208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1254084#post1254084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was inspired by the same thing. I wouldn\u2019t make it a big Wickerman conspiracy like on South Park, but more a thing with Fate, and certain cults respond to it.<br /> Xochiquetzal has Marilyn Monroe\u2019s skin (and thus Mantle) in her collection.<br /> <br /> (I came up with that because I have a whole list of potential US deities that player characters will have to track down in various afterlives and so-forth, to assemble a potential full Pantheon for Columbia. They\u2019ll chose which directions to follow shaping which possibilities they find, but Marilyn Monroe, if they get that sacrificial skin from Xoxhiquetzal, is the potential love, beauty, and celebrity goddess)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Now I'm just curious how the hell <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Xochiquetzal got Marilyn Monroe\u2019s skin?</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1675-weirdboyz","name":"Weirdboyz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1675_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"212"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T19:26:29-07:00","id":1256613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weirdboyz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1256208#post1256208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Now I'm just curious how the hell <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Xochiquetzal got Marilyn Monroe\u2019s skin?</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>You think the Teotl didn\u2019t lay claim to all territory in Mexico even after the Aztec Empire fell? And they didn\u2019t leave just because Mexico then lost California to the US (\u201cwe didn\u2019t cross the border, the border crossed us!\u201d) Plenty of other Gods in SoCal too, but the Teotl cults around sacrifice for celebrity (and OF celebrity) are powerful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T19:51:27-07:00","id":1256618,"title":"","content":"Fun tidbit for my Mal\u2019akhim project: Sutekh, while sharing his pantheon\u2019s hostility toward Aten and Atenism, is historically the least suspicious and most friendly Netjer toward the Mal\u2019akhim.<br /> <br /> Like them, he is a patron of desert nomads, who looks with more fondness upon shepherds than farmers. He was the lone major Egyptian god who had not fatebound himself to the ruling Dynasty in the early New Kingdom, and so was theoretically free to interneve against a certain adopted prince who had become a Chosen Mal\u2019akhim Scion, unleashing plagues to free slaves - but he chose not to - appreciating the chaos being unleashed to shake up the social order. Similarly he sympathized again with the Bedouin tribes who followed the Prophet Mohammed, even when their sons turned and invaded Egypt.<br /> <br /> Unlike Judaism and Islam, he\u2019s comparatively less sympathetic toward Christianity. It isn\u2019t directly rooted in a foundation from Semitic nomads, and the (Pauline) theology that won out is distinctly of a Hellenistic flavor. He\u2019s met Jesus, and something about him vaguely reminds Sutekh of Wesir - so not a fan.<br /> <br /> <br /> Sutekh's position as a feared, but respected, Jinn in the eyes of Egyptian Muslims may in fact contribute to why the broader Cult of Re (under which broad umbrella most Sutekh Cults fall) has been able to survive in modern Egypt, tying with Coptic Christianity for second largest religion in Egypt. Meanwhile, the death &amp; resurrection of Osiris/Wesir centered Cult of Isis was not nearly as successful in the homeland, and primarily thrives in the Egyptian diaspora (hence using more Greek than Kemetic names).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 09-22-2018, 11:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T22:31:32-07:00","id":1257312,"title":"","content":"So Disney Hades is a fantastic character who isn\u2019t remotely Hades. What god would best fit that personality instead? My thinking right now is Veles having the right intersection of \u201cUnderworld god\u201d and \u201cTrickster\u201d for it to fit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-26T03:28:06-07:00","id":1257332,"title":"","content":"Erlik Khan of the Tanrilar comes to mind as being very similar to the pop-culture trope of an evil Hades.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-29T23:46:25-07:00","id":1258125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Adrasalieth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1253865#post1253865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's talk healthcare !</div> </div> </div> </div>Currently, roughly 15 million out of the 7.4 billion people on earth are healthcare professionals, which amounts to 0.2% of the population. If 1% of the population are scions (9% of whom would have the healer calling assuming an even distribution) and 0.1% are visited scions (27% of whom would have the healer calling assuming an even distribution,) that means 0.117% of the world's population is composed of scions with the healer calling, before you even bring into account the numerous mythic species with healing abilities out there.<br /> <br /> Chances are, a healthcare professional beyond the lowest levels, without divine blood is truly few and far between, possibly to the point that without evidence of divine blood, you can't even apply to medschool (bear in mind, due to the same distribution, medschools would likely have faculties consisting entirely of scions and magical denizens, so having a few HR folks on staff with &quot;scent of the divine&quot; is probably par for the course.) Nurses and medical technicians could be as low as 40-50% divine by population (many of whom would likely be birthright followers to one of the doctors on staff,) but actual doctors and researchers would likely be almost 100% scions and healing-denizens, and even the move from nurse to nurse-practitioner would probably be much harder if not impossible for someone who couldn't pass a &quot;scent of the divine&quot; test. The concept of medicine outside of divine magic, is probably not a thing in the alternate-history-godworld setting. There are probably a few scions of science-based deities, who have taken the healer calling upon their ascension to hero-tier, who are trying to revolutionize medicine and put it into the hands of mortals, but beyond that, in a world where the medicine-men, shamans, druidic-healers, and humor-alchemists of the past were actually 100% legit, the world of medicine and healthcare is likely an extension of those traditions, rather than something completely different that supplanted it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1576,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1576-mjorkk","user":"mjorkk","date":". 09-30-2018, 03:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1576-mjorkk","name":"mjorkk","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T04:30:17-07:00","id":1258363,"title":"","content":"20) Islam in Iran? <br /> <br /> ZOROASTRIANISM FOR DAYZ! Islam in Iran still exists, but only on a relatively even level with Zoroastrianism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24271-froggo","name":"Froggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24271_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-01T06:19:50-07:00","id":1258375,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1258363#post1258363\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">20) Islam in Iran? <br /> <br /> ZOROASTRIANISM FOR DAYZ! Islam in Iran still exists, but only on a relatively even level with Zoroastrianism.</div> </div> </div> </div>I keep on going back and forth on this myself. The pros are obvious. The cons are what it means for the cultural context of the Parsi and Irani diaspora populations elsewhere (particularly India), and how much reconsidering of Middle Eastern geopolitics it brings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-02T14:12:56-07:00","id":1258590,"title":"","content":"<b>Consecutive Life Sentences:</b> are now reserved for religions that implement the cycle of reincarnation. As for how the judicial system goes about enforcing these sentences... the general public doesn't like to talk about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-02T16:48:37-07:00","id":1258615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1258590#post1258590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Consecutive Life Sentences:</b> are now reserved for religions that implement the cycle of reincarnation. As for how the judicial system goes about enforcing these sentences... the general public doesn't like to talk about it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I would assume Yama (Dharmaraja/Yan Luo/Emma-O) takes that into account so a souls serves their remaining multiple life sentences in Naraka (Diyu/Jigoku) before they're reborn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-02T18:15:01-07:00","id":1258633,"title":"","content":"In the Ancient World, it was the norm for every soul to be judged by the pantheon they worshipped in life, or the one closest to the culture they lived in, and thus it was common for people who committed atrocities against other cultures or faiths to still be rewarded for their devotion. The turning point in this norm came between the Roman Mantles of the Theoi and the ascendent Christian Mantles of the Mal'akhim in late antiquity over the soul of Emperor Diocletian. It was that dispute that led to the first inter-pantheon extradition treaty over mortal souls, and a relative policy of tolerance toward mortals keeping their gods (compared with European history in world).<br /> <br /> Underworld extradition courts are now accepted institutions of the cosmos.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-08T06:09:13-07:00","id":1259576,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mjorkk</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1258125#post1258125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... If 1% of the population are scions (9% of whom would have the healer calling assuming an even distribution) and 0.1% are visited scions ...</div> </div> </div> </div>Are those &quot;official&quot; numbers? I would have put those numbers one or two orders of magnitude lower than that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24080-cybertier","name":"cybertier","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-08T16:57:38-07:00","id":1259682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cybertier</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1259576#post1259576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are those &amp;quot;official&amp;quot; numbers? I would have put those numbers one or two orders of magnitude lower than that.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are no official numbers. The books note that they're going to why away from official numbers beyond &quot;Scions are pretty rare&quot;, and that the number of Scions in the World is &quot;As many as there need to be for your game&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-08T19:33:09-07:00","id":1259711,"title":"","content":"I kind of want to try to create a city setting in the same vein as Chicago by Night and the like with several dozen Scions all in one urban area. The potential for socio-political tomfoolery alone makes me giggle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-12T21:28:03-07:00","id":1260390,"title":"","content":"Just as there are mortal rebellions against mortal systems of government, so too are their divine rebellions against divine systems of government. This has lead to new pantheons organizing themselves into &quot;divine dictatorships&quot; as their chief deity is habitually replaced by means of a violent coup by their traitorous subjects.<br /> <br /> <br /> Due to their spiritual and religious significance, a number of recreational and hallucinogenic drugs were never made illegal, as doing so would have angered the pantheons who rely on their usage.<br /> <br /> <br /> Modern medical treatments have resulted in therianthropy being seen by the public as an <i>&quot;incurable, but manageable&quot;</i> STD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-22T23:58:59-08:00","id":1270027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1196996#post1196996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">9) Thor comics didn't happen in the World, instead Jack Kirby introduced the &quot;New Gods&quot; from the getgo when he was working for Marvel. DC did still create Mongul in reaction to Darkseid, but Thanos never happened in the back-and-forth. Orion was a founding Avenger instead of Thor, and Darkseid is the big-bad of the upcoming Avengers Infinity War movie.</div> </div> </div> </div>I now have this image of the original Avengers being OMAC, Mister Miracle, Big Barda, The Demon, and Machine Man instead of the Hulk/Captain America, Ant Man, Wasp, Thor, and Iron Man. Maybe Devil Dinosaur too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-23T18:23:02-08:00","id":1270243,"title":"","content":"Just gonna note that even without ACTIVE meddling, the World's Insurance Companies will have a VERY different outlook on covering &quot;Acts of the Gods&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-24T17:24:23-08:00","id":1270460,"title":"","content":"This is going by what I've heard regarding 2nd edition and how the World is supposedly aware of all this mythology stuff being real:<br /> <br /> In a modernized world where magic goes mainstream, and the Health purview is a thing, my headcanon is that many of the world's sub-cultures have appealed to higher powers for a way to make their dreams into reality. And the scions who agree to help them are probably rolling in cash.<br /> <br /> In fact, I could even see conventions for such people being moved to incognita pocket planes, where they're safely protected from intolerant ass holes who would otherwise try to attack them!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T03:34:11-08:00","id":1273697,"title":"","content":"Laboratories would prohibit the usage of any religious symbol inside of his facilities, as any kind of religious or superstitious ritual, to reduce the potential to it affect the results of experiments. The only allowed would be on the entrance, where would be altars for Sciences and Knowledge Gods. (Athena, Thoth, Odin, etc.).<br /> <br /> Universities would have courses on Divine Relations, to study the relations between the many Pantheons, as specific courses and subjects for each pantheon. There would be many universities with patronage of a specific God or pantheons, but even then inside clubs of fraternity houses would have their own patrons. Also, many, many papers on the effects and influences of the Gods in the society, and discussion of Who is patron of What city, place or society.<br /> <br /> A Multi-Pantheon Pact would forbid interventions and Scions, of any kind, to participate on the Olympics, Football World Cup, Formula 1 and other sport events. Betting on those, though, is a very different thing.<br /> <br /> There are many more small Gods for many more different important things and technologies: like a New Muse for Cinema, a Norse God of the Ocean Liners and Steam Boats, a Hindu God of Spices and Trade, etc. All of then were Scions that got important enough to be linked to this invention/new structure/thing. If those are Gods or just Demigods that are essentially immortal, is hard to say. None of those things or social structures can be from after 1900.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12934-manbat","name":"Manbat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12934_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T00:40:21-08:00","id":1273848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manbat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1273697#post1273697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There would be many universities with patronage of a specific God or pantheons, but even then inside clubs of fraternity houses would have their own patrons. .</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, this one is mentioned offhand in text! I believe the Origins book mentions that there's a university in Memphis, Egypt, that bears the name of Imhotep, a Scion of the Netjer! So yes, divinely-sponsored colleges are very much a real thing in the World!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-12T03:35:14-08:00","id":1274010,"title":"","content":"So... Deifans are a thing, right? So I was thinking about a kind of social net/app that allows the Bands so inclined to change informations and updates among each others. Something like &quot;We are at X doing Y and if other Scions would like to join us, pls shout/like!&quot;. Or maybe gather some kind of database about Titanspawn about their habits and weaknesses.<br /> <br /> I think I would call it Band-it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23841-hayashi","name":"Hayashi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23841_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T12:41:22-08:00","id":1278382,"title":"","content":"Every time I read about Scion, I can't help but think about the Saints from the Saint's Row videogame series (mostly from before SR4, but including Gat out of Hell). Start as small time hustlers and criminals, get more and more famous as time goes on, eventually becoming international celebrities making tons of money, still doing the same kind of criminal stuff (Fatebinding?) and eventually having to travel to Hell, rescue one of their members, saving Santa Claus, etc.<br /> <br /> Does anyone else get this vibe from those games?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T08:02:52-08:00","id":1278584,"title":"","content":"Due to the crazy nature in which Gods and Titans reproduce, schools have been forced to change their Sex Ed programs for students that come from &quot;less mundane&quot; heritages.<br /> <br /> <br /> Additionally, all schools are required to have a minimum of 2 Heroric level security guards, in case the school experiences a supernatural emergency.<br /> <br /> <br /> The majority of animals with acting careers have become mythical creatures, with a level of sentience comparable to those of humans. This has resulted in them receiving the same benefits as any human celebrity might possess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T10:28:25-08:00","id":1278626,"title":"","content":"I wonder what things like video games and movies look like in this world. Is it just assumed that most larger than life heroes (Lara Croft, Indiana Jones, etc) are Scions?<br /> <br /> I sadly imagine that there's a negative impact on science fiction. So much SF is based on imagining more exciting worlds, but seems like the Scion world is pretty full of adventure and wonder on it's own. Would things like Star Wars, Star Trek, or Doctor Who be replaced by something more grounded in Mythic Reality? Maybe the Enterprise is an actual ship traveling between the various godly realms and whatnot?<br /> <br /> Also not to be trite, but would something like #MeToo be vastly different in the Scion world? I mean, if Zeus shows up, lies about who he is, gets you pregnant, abandons you...I mean, that's not healthy at all. And I'm not trying to be offensive or anything with this, but the power dynamics of a God-mortal relationship are even more screwed up than movie producer-aspiring actress would ever be. Again, I know this is a sensitive topic, but it's not like the Gods have a good track record of not abusing humanity. If a love god or goddess shows up and puts their supernatural whammy on you, can you consent? Is that rape?<br /> <br /> I can imagine the legal system having all sorts of different rules and laws regarding crimes committed by Gods and Scions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T12:11:24-08:00","id":1278658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChewyGranola</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1278626#post1278626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what things like video games and movies look like in this world. Is it just assumed that most larger than life heroes (Lara Croft, Indiana Jones, etc) are Scions?<br /> <br /> I sadly imagine that there's a negative impact on science fiction. So much SF is based on imagining more exciting worlds, but seems like the Scion world is pretty full of adventure and wonder on it's own. Would things like Star Wars, Star Trek, or Doctor Who be replaced by something more grounded in Mythic Reality? Maybe the Enterprise is an actual ship traveling between the various godly realms and whatnot?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'd say that a chunk of the medieval fantasy genre have become something akin to historical documentaries, rather than fictional stories. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And I don't think Zeus is too big on lying about his identity. If he got somebody pregnant, he made it pretty clear that it was him doing it. Or, if for some reason he chose to remain anonymous, Hera made it pretty damn clear as to who the father was.<br /> <br /> <br /> As for a legal system, I would say the only judicial system the Gods would answer to is one of their own making. Religion exists in real life, too, and I have never heard of anybody trying to sue / charge a deity for anything. They don't give half a rat's ass about mortal laws and customs. Seriously, the Theoi is probably the most narcissistic pantheon I have ever come across, and the idea of Zeus allowing any mortal to prosecute him is laughable at best.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 01-04-2019, 03:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T15:25:00-08:00","id":1278712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChewyGranola</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1278626#post1278626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what things like video games and movies look like in this world. Is it just assumed that most larger than life heroes (Lara Croft, Indiana Jones, etc) are Scions?<br /> <br /> I sadly imagine that there's a negative impact on science fiction. So much SF is based on imagining more exciting worlds, but seems like the Scion world is pretty full of adventure and wonder on it's own. Would things like Star Wars, Star Trek, or Doctor Who be replaced by something more grounded in Mythic Reality? Maybe the Enterprise is an actual ship traveling between the various godly realms and whatnot?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Origins tier is explictly Mortal, and on a rough Action Hero Level, so it can be presumed that there are mortals who are that good.<br /> <br /> As for Sci Fi. I think it's pretty much the same, especially Sci Fi like Star Trek, that is about imagining a possible future, and the impact technology can have on peoples lives.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23677-the-eternal-keeper","name":"The Eternal Keeper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T20:15:12-08:00","id":1278752,"title":"","content":"Depending on how visible you're putting your Divine I feel like comic books could be something that have drastically taken a change. Superhero stories started out as modern day mythologies with the same larger than life style characters. With Into the Spiderverse we saw Miles owning Spider-Man comics that were effectively identical to what we'd have today, but they were biographical. I could see something similar happening to Scions who got big enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-05T08:44:19-08:00","id":1278825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AutoDefenestrate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1278752#post1278752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depending on how visible you're putting your Divine I feel like comic books could be something that have drastically taken a change. Superhero stories started out as modern day mythologies with the same larger than life style characters. With Into the Spiderverse we saw Miles owning Spider-Man comics that were effectively identical to what we'd have today, but they were biographical. I could see something similar happening to Scions who got big enough.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Or, if we're talking about DC, the comics serve as windows to parallel universes.<br /> <br /> What does this have to do with Scion, you might ask?<br /> <br /> Well, imagine if the comic books followed the adventures of somebody inside a terra incognita?<br /> <br /> Suddenly, your action packed comic books have taken on the role of a mythical news article!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-06T14:40:44-08:00","id":1279050,"title":"","content":"Wait! What the heck are fortune cookies like in Scion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-08T09:30:33-08:00","id":1279486,"title":"","content":"Still as fake and artificial as ever?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-09T00:04:25-08:00","id":1279653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1279486#post1279486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still as fake and artificial as ever?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You say that, but my dad once got a very, VERY relevant fortune cookie advice. Our whole table went silent for a few seconds! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-09T14:23:13-08:00","id":1279781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hayashi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1274010#post1274010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So... Deifans are a thing, right? So I was thinking about a kind of social net/app that allows the Bands so inclined to change informations and updates among each others. Something like &quot;We are at X doing Y and if other Scions would like to join us, pls shout/like!&quot;. Or maybe gather some kind of database about Titanspawn about their habits and weaknesses.<br /> <br /> I think I would call it Band-it.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Band-it must also show near by supernatural incidents, who participated, keep reviews of each Hero (given by previous band-mates) and keep tipical areas of action (like if a there is a hero for a specific community).<br /> <br /> Pray Away - An app that show the multiple Temples, Shrines and Sacred places near you. You can filter by religion, see specific prays and rituals, check if there are supernatural stuff around it and even see reviews<br /> <br /> Divino-pedia - A easy app to find information about multiple creatures, rituals, deities, history and eve images of multiple religions. (A variation might even have an image scanning functionality for special creatures, which could make it somewhat like a Pokedex for supernatural creatures.)<br /> /* In a second thought, this second part might be an actual Relic. *//<br /> <br /> Also, James Randy is an Incarnation of Odin that doesnt like fake prophets and psychics.<br /> <br /> P.s.: I am terrible at naming. If someone have better ideas for naming apps, I appreciate suggestions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12934,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12934-manbat","user":"Manbat","date":". 01-09-2019, 05:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12934-manbat","name":"Manbat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12934_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-09T01:06:57-07:00","id":1543401,"title":"","content":"Sorry for the post necromancy, but I need to share this one:<br /> <br /> George Washington was an Incarnate Scion of King Arthur, and the Founding Fathers were his Knights of the Round Table, but he never went past the Hero tier. I get that one from Once and Future, which mentions that there's a Gate to Camelot everywhere a Scion of the Pendragon experiences their Visitation; with Mount Vernon, Virginia being one of the listed locations. Washington deciding to retire after his second term as president, symbolically refusing the crown of kingship, was him eventually deciding against becoming a Demigod and pursuing the Pendragon Mantle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28221,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28221-chronorebel","user":"ChronoRebel","date":". 09-10-2025, 10:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28221-chronorebel","name":"ChronoRebel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-09T16:34:33-07:00","id":1543461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChronoRebel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1543401#post1543401\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for the post necromancy, but I need to share this one:<br /> <br /> George Washington was an Incarnate Scion of King Arthur, and the Founding Fathers were his Knights of the Round Table, but he never went past the Hero tier. I get that one from Once and Future, which mentions there's a Gate to Camelot everywhere a Scion of the Pendragon experiences their Visitation; with Mount Vernon, Virginia being one of the listed locations. Washington deciding to retire after his second term as president, symbolically refusing the crown of kingship, was him eventually deciding against becoming a Demigod and pursuing the Pendragon Mantle.</div> </div> </div> </div>If Washington rejected Demigodhood in favor of the Republic, then George did what Arthur failed to do. <i>Le Morte d'Arthur </i>is a highly political book. The text centers around the problem of the &quot;King's Two Bodies,&quot; or as we'd put it Arthur's duties as a King and his responsibilities as a man. Arthur failed the test Washington both understood the difference between himself and his role and the difference between his desires and what was good for the nation. <br /> <br /> Washington in choosing the Republic over a crown transcended the mantle of the Pendragon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-06T04:25:01-08:00","id":1549005,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1197021#post1197021\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I personally read Artemis and Athena both as lesbians, but that might just be because of my crushes on them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Artemis is gay. Athena, being the goddess of Wisdom never got caught. ;-) Thus we don't know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-06T04:35:39-08:00","id":1549006,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksol-aeternium</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1198069#post1198069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This makes me imagine the chaos from Scions stemming from the gods of destroyed peoples/cultures now venting their frustrations on the oppressor culture by destroying the current regime. Just how many different Native American pantheons are we aware of exactly?</div> </div> </div> </div>Why not have the ideas of Washington and Franklin respected and work out. Both George and Ben wanted to bring the Native Americans into the American culture. The larger tribes and federations to become states. They never got any traction on the policy. However in the World they could be highly successful and the USA amalgamated rather than crushed Native Americans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-06T04:40:49-08:00","id":1549007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1237424#post1237424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Total sub in the bedroom. It's where he wants to be dominated after being an &quot;alpha&quot;-asshole everywhere else.</div> </div> </div> </div>As Lucifer reminded us in the Sandman comics. &quot;<br /> Masochists always demand to be in charge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-15T19:57:16-07:00","id":1549350,"title":"","content":"A lot of people claim to have met a deity or claim the other parent of their child was a god. It's usually reserved for tabloids because if it's true the god will probably own up and frankly it be more exciting if Zeus wasn't having an affair, and if it's not true then it's just someone seeking out drama.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28147-snailslayer","name":"Snailslayer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-08T23:07:04-08:00","id":1557402,"title":"","content":"The <i>'Monster Lover'</i> community not only exists unironically, but also functions as a Titan cult!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-04-06T10:34:23-07:00","id":1559249,"title":"","content":"There is a giant Aztec empire ruling what is in another world Mexiko and middle america. Bordering in the north against the USA and in the south against Brazil. On both sides giant border walls where erected and there have been multiple tries to invade the Aztec empire all failing miserable against their divine blood magic and scion warriors. The country is a divine dictatorship where Aztec Scions rule and every crime, including worship of non-aztec gods is punished by being sacrificed. Both border walls are created using forge God magic and manned by elite soldiers and Scions. Especially in the US politicians use the fear against the Aztec empire as an argument why every citizen should always be armed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28820-akhelos","name":"Akhelos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-11-02T15:31:34-08:00","id":1565090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChewyGranola</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196981-headcanons-about-the-world?p=1278626#post1278626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I sadly imagine that there's a negative impact on science fiction. So much SF is based on imagining more exciting worlds, but seems like the Scion world is pretty full of adventure and wonder on it's own. Would things like Star Wars, Star Trek, or Doctor Who be replaced by something more grounded in Mythic Reality? Maybe the Enterprise is an actual ship traveling between the various godly realms and whatnot?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Correct me if I'm wrong, but doesn't Hindu mythology depict the gods as having access to technology that would not only compete with, but potentially even surpass what we currently have today?<br /> <br /> Like, a bow that uses nuclear warheads for ammunition?<br /> <br /> Or a planetary scale robot that shoots people with orbital death lasers?<br /> <br /> Just check out Asura's Wrath for inspiration. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom